note Exercism-style exercise "knapsack": https://exercism.org/tracks/python/exercises/knapsack
note SPDX-License-Identifier: Apache-2.0 WITH LLVM-exception
note Item i weighs ws[i] and is worth vs[i]. maximumvalue is the largest total worth of items (each
note taken at most once) whose total weight is at most cap (cap at most 1000).
note Check it with: sh exercise.sh exercises/knapsack
om2
const KMAX ulong 1001
global kdp ulong KMAX
fn additem w ulong v ulong cap ulong to void
for k ulong add sub cap w 1
d = sub cap k
x = add get kdp sub d w v
if gt x get kdp d
put kdp d x
end
end
end
fn maximumvalue ws view ulong * vs view ulong * cap ulong to ulong
for c ulong add cap 1
put kdp c 0
end
for i ulong len ws
w = get ws i
if le w cap
additem w get vs i cap
end
end
ret get kdp cap
end
